  "body": "In a sought-after pocket of Murrays Bay, this charming home has all the ingredients for easy coastal living. Just a short walk to the beach, cafes, shops and excellent local schools, including Rangitoto College, it combines character, modern comfort and a family-friendly layout.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, open-plan living centres around a stylish designer kitchen with excellent storage, flowing effortlessly to a private outdoor courtyard complete with its own kids' playhouse - a lovely spot for sunny afternoons, relaxed entertaining and time with family and friends.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four generous bedrooms include a principal suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while a second lounge offers a cosy retreat for reading, a kids' play area or simply some extra space to spread out.\r\n\r\nBeautiful character features, light modern interiors and handy loft storage add to the appeal. With so much on offer in this popular coastal location, this is a home that deserves to be seen.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n\r\n* Gated driveway\r\n* Single internal access garage\r\n* Off-street parking\r\n* Fully fenced\r\n* Flat lawn area\r\n* Space for potential swimming pool\r\n* Separate laundry\r\n* 3 modern bathrooms\r\n* Vaulted ceilings and character features\r\n* Indoor ceiling speakers\r\n* 2 heat pumps",
